ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/03cfac882195aba07f9694516f17db9b.poster.avif?t=1686150721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/03cfac882195aba07f9694516f17db9b.webm?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/03cfac882195aba07f9694516f17db9b.mp4?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>After years of war and famine, all the survivors left the devasteted region, except for one brave warrior.<br><br>The young warrior-mage who still lives in the devastated country is the only one who can try to end Diabot's evil hegemony.<br><br>If he will fail like his predecessors, the reign will be doom once for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/b66e42d98155115a324ce8b9fb767a3f.poster.avif?t=1686150721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/b66e42d98155115a324ce8b9fb767a3f.webm?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/b66e42d98155115a324ce8b9fb767a3f.mp4?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2>:<br><strong>- Five Bosses<br><br>- Collect money to buy new powerups<br><br>- 3 Different Endings<br><br>- 3 Game modes<br><br>- Dozens of different enemies</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/6efc524d4bf17cedcb4942dd32b44853.poster.avif?t=1686150721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/6efc524d4bf17cedcb4942dd32b44853.webm?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922000/extras/6efc524d4bf17cedcb4942dd32b44853.mp4?t=1686150721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
